.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ac7207c04829d13ec69606a345ebb396.mp4?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Chain Reactions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ad1b5dce08ed0287b45ae3a5efe7d0f2.poster.avif?t=1745154219\" width=620 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ad1b5dce08ed0287b45ae3a5efe7d0f2.webm?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ad1b5dce08ed0287b45ae3a5efe7d0f2.mp4?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with with friends to build faster and make larger chains.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/69e101427972c5a93186eb9ab4d5072c.poster.avif?t=1745154219\" width=620 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/69e101427972c5a93186eb9ab4d5072c.webm?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/69e101427972c5a93186eb9ab4d5072c.mp4?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make huge chains with advanced techniques</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/f635afe5dc6e9671a17387c90a13d7a5.poster.avif?t=1745154219\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/f635afe5dc6e9671a17387c90a13d7a5.webm?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/f635afe5dc6e9671a17387c90a13d7a5.mp4?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two players, one keyboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ae1c1e547bbfec67382aecc673a5715b.poster.avif?t=1745154219\" width=620 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ae1c1e547bbfec67382aecc673a5715b.webm?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950640/extras/ae1c1e547bbfec67382aecc673a5715b.mp4?t=1745154219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Reaktor Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One day, a bored engineer at the Chernobyl nuclear power plant modified the\u00a0SKALA\u00a0control program with a score function so it would be more fun to play.\u00a0He began making larger and larger reactions, until one day he\u00a0messed\u00a0up and caused\u00a0a meltdown.</i> <i><strong>But he was addicted.</strong></i> <i>Years later, he sneaked\u00a0back into the rubble, stole\u00a0the modified control code and published\u00a0it\u00a0as an internationally acclaimed video game called\u00a0REAKTOR.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com